 and closed at its high 2611.00", "H1": "last H1 bar 1789920000000 (2611.00/2643.70/2605.96/2635.82) is a bull breakout bar closing in the top 21% of its range", "M15": "bull leg from 2568.16 (bar 97) with higher lows into 2643.70 (bar 118) and a one-bar inside pullback (bar 119)", "location": "upper third of the H4 range; prior congestion 2646.54-2658.79 overhead, H4 range top 2700.00 above that"}, "setup": {"type": "breakout pullback (High 1/High 2 buy in M15 bull leg after a wide bull breakout bar)", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "clear", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high - signal/pullback bar after the 2643.70 breakout bar", "price_field": "high", "price": "2642.5", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1789922700000, "close_time_ms": 1789923599999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 118 low 2616.09 - wide bull breakout bar and last higher low of the leg", "price_field": "low", "price": "2616.09", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 118, "open_time_ms": 1789921800000, "close_time_ms": 1789922699999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 118 (open_time 1789921800000) is a wide bull bar: open 2618.68, low 2616.09, high 2643.70, close 2640.67 - closes 3.03 under its high, 24.58 above its low, and takes out bar 116's 2625.32 high.", "M15 higher-low sequence in the bull leg: 2568.16 (bar 97, open_time 1789902900000) -> 2605.96 (bar 116, 1789920000000) -> 2616.09 (bar 118) -> 2633.44 (bar 119); leg is 75.54 points and has not traded back below bar 118's low.", "M15 bar 119 (open 2640.67, high 2642.50, low 2633.44, close 2635.82) is a one-bar inside pullback holding above bar 118's midpoint 2629.89 - a shallow pause, not a reversal, after the breakout bar.", "H1 bar 1789920000000 (open 2611.00, high 2643.70, low 2605.96, close 2635.82) breaks the prior H1 bar's 2611.00 high (1789916400000) and the 2586 region that capped the prior bars, closing in the top 21% of its range.", "H4 context is current and its last closed bar (1789905600000) opened 2577.69 and closed at its 2611.00 high after the 2568.16 pullback; D1 and H4 always-in are both long, so the higher-timeframe lean is with buying the first pullback after the breakout bar."], "evidence_against": ["Location: 2635.82 sits about 81% up the H4 range 2357.18-2700.00; the H4 context lists three failed upside probes (2537.57, 2680.00, 2700.00) each giving back 60-125 points with no close acceptance.", "The pending trigger 2642.50 is only 4.04 under the prior 2646.54 high (H1 1789840800000) and 16.29 under 2658.79 (H1 1789837200000), so the fill would occur inside the 2632-2658 distribution zone that broke down to 2568.16.", "M15 bar 119 is a bear bar (open 2640.67, close 2635.82) closing in the lower third of its 2633.44-2642.50 range, so the signal-bar candle itself is not a strong bull bar.", "The 2700.00 top (H1 bar 1789808400000, high 2700.00, close 2641.14) was followed by three bear H1 bars into 2568.16, showing sellers still active at range highs; the current leg has retraced only about 57% of that 131.84-point drop.", "D1 phase is 'range' with the 2771.00 boundary (bar 90) untested since the buy-climax bar, so a long at 2642.50 is a mid-range entry rather than a confirmed break of the upper boundary."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["The trigger is a pending stop, not a filled trade; follow-through of the H1 breakout bar is unobserved.", "The pullback count is ambiguous - the one-bar pause at bar 119 can be read as High 1 or as the second shallow pullback - so a dip toward 2616.09 before the trigger cannot be excluded.", "H4 context lags the decision by one H1 bar (last H4 close 2611.00 versus current M15 2635.82); the forming H4 bar is not supplied."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 close above 2658.79 with follow-through would confirm a break of the prior congestion and strengthen the long toward the 2700.00 range top.", "An M15 close below 2616.09 (bar 118 low) would invalidate the wide bull bar and shift the read back to rotation toward 2568.16 and the H4 range floor 2357.18.", "Several overlapping M15 closes between roughly 2616 and 2658 would place price in the range middle and argue against new longs.", "Two consecutive closes above 2700.00 would shift the H4 read from trading-range to bull-trend breakout."]}, "latest_trader_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "NO_TRADE", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789930799999, "market_context": {"read": "Raw H1/M15 show a genuine bull breakout: H1 bar 116 (open_time 1789916400000, open 2584.38, close 2611.00 at its high) broke the 12-bar H1 range 2568.16-2594.57 (bars 104-115), with follow-through on H1 bar 117 (high 2643.70). Price is now in a 7-bar overlapping pullback (M15 bars 113-119). Larger contexts are two-sided ranges: H4 2357.18-2700.00 with three unaccepted tops (2537.57, 2680.00, 2700.00) and D1 post-climax range 2357.18-2771 with 2700/2771 rejection.", "decision_location": "Last close 2625.53 sits ~78% of the H4 range 2357.18-2700.00 and ~65% of the D1 range 2357.18-2771 - upper-middle of both ranges, not at an edge.", "key_levels": "Overhead shelf 2643.70 (M15 bar 110 high; H1 bar 117 high) / 2645.88 (M15 bar 112 and H1 bar 118 highs); support 2622.06 (M15 bar 116 low) / 2622.24 (M15 bar 119 low), then 2605.96 (M15 bar 108 low), 2568.16 H4 pullback low.", "context_freshness": "D1 and H4 contexts both supplied as current; no stale/missing read required."}, "setup": {"type": "bull-flag / breakout-pullback candidate, not actionable at the frozen bar", "trigger_status": "absent", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "poor", "no_trade_reason": "poor_location"}, "decision_timeframe": null, "context_timeframes_used": ["M15", "H1", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "none", "trigger": null, "invalidation": null, "evidence_for": ["Location is mid-range, not an edge: last M15 close 2625.53 (M15 bar 119, open_time 1789929900000) is ~78% of the H4 context range 2357.18-2700.00 and ~65% of the D1 range 2357.18-2771, while the H4 context shows three stalled tops (2537.57, 2680.00, 2700.00) that each closed 61.51-124.48 under their highs with no acceptance.", "The pullback is a tight overlapping barbwire, not a tradable flag edge: M15 bars 112-119 (1789923600000-1789929900000) all overlap inside 2622.06-2645.88 (~0.9% wide), with equal lows 2622.06 (bar 116) and 2622.24 (bar 119) - no breakout and no bull reversal bar exists at the decision bar.", "Momentum at the frozen bar points down, not up: M15 bar 119 (open 2631.65, high 2632.57, low 2622.24, close 2625.53) is a bear bar closing 3.29 above its low, and H1 bars 118/119 (open 2637.10/close 2630.17 and open 2626.07/close 2625.53) are two consecutive bear bars.", "A long trigger above 2636.43 (M15 bar 118 high) is crowded: it enters 6.91-9.45 under the 2643.70/2645.88 shelf (M15 bar 110 high 2643.70; H1 bar 117 high 2643.70, H1 bar 118 high 2645.88), so the nearest opposing structure is closer than the 14.37-point invalidation at 2622.06.", "The short side is equally unactionable: no bear reversal bar and no lower-high channel, and a break of 2622.24 would be sold against the intact H1 bull leg (bars 116-117) and the H4 always-in long."], "evidence_against": ["Strongest bull case: H1 bar 116 (1789916400000) is a bull breakout bar (open 2584.38 to close 2611.00 at its high) out of the 12-bar H1 range 2568.16-2594.57, and H1 bar 117 followed through to a 2643.70 high - breakout plus follow-through, so the current overlap is a legitimate bull flag rather than a failure.", "The pullback holds above the M15 spike low 2605.96 (bar 108) and above the breakout zone; equal lows 2622.06/2622.24 form a small double bottom, so a pending stop above 2645.88 with invalidation at 2622.06 would be structurally defensible and has not been invalidated by any supplied bar.", "H4 context records 22 bars of higher highs (2450.87 to 2700.00) and higher pullback lows (2370.54, 2436.87, 2495.82) from the 2358.62 low, and the last H4 bar (1789905600000) closed at its own high 2611.00, so the bull leg is intact and 2568.16 was not broken."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the H4/D1 range-top supply or the H1/H4 bull leg dominates the next several bars; the context labels are fallible descriptions and the raw H1 breakout with follow-through is real, so a stop above 2645.88 could still resolve into a range-top test.", "The M15 pullback has produced no signal bar yet, so the same overlapping bars could resolve up (flag breakout) or down (failed flag) within the next bar; pending-versus-failed cannot be settled from supplied bars.", "H4 'phase: range' and 'primary_regime: trading-range' conflict with the D1 'primary_regime: bull-trend' label; neither is treated as a vote."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 bull bar closing on its high through 2632.57, then a triggered stop above 2645.88 holding above it, would make the bull-flag breakout actionable with invalidation at 2622.06.", "Two consecutive closes above 2645.88, and then acceptance above 2700.00, would shift the read from range rotation to bull breakout per the H4 transition conditions.", "A close below 2622.06 and then below 2605.96 (M15 bar 108 low) would break the double bottom and the spike low, re-opening rotation toward 2495.82 and the H4 floor 2436.87/2358.62.", "A close below 2568.16 (H4 pullback low) would negate the H1 bull leg and shift the structural read bearish."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, open_time 1779494400000 to 1789776000000, with the decision at the close of the final bar (close_time 1789862399999).", "Window high is 2771 (bar 90, open_time 1787270400000); window low is 1368.42 (bar 14, open_time 1780704000000).", "Bars 10-14 (1780358400000-1780704000000) are five overlapping bear bars driving 2006.17 down to 1368.42; bar 14 closes 1568.55, about 200 points above its low, a sell-climax tail.", "Bar 88 (1787097600000) opens 1916.51 inside the prior consolidation and closes 2252.16 near its 2293.8 high; bars 89-90 close 2326.32 and 2515.3, and bar 90 prints 2771 and closes 255.7 below that high.", "Bars 91-119 overlap between 2357.18 (bar 102 low, 1788307200000) and 2700 (bar 119 high); bar 90's low of 2325.31 was never revisited.", "Roughly equal lows at 2357.18 (bar 102) and 2358.62 (bar 115, 1789430400000) form a double bottom at the range low, followed by four higher closes (2416.57, 2446.22, 2612.02, 2632.98).", "The final bar's close 2632.98 is the highest close in the whole window, while its high 2700 stays 71 below bar 90's 2771 high; the last bar closes 67.02 under its own high."], "evidence_against": ["Bar 90's 2771 high with a close 255.7 lower is a buy-climax bar, and the 29 bars since then overlap inside the range rather than trending - trading-range behavior after a climax.", "No close has exceeded 2771; the recent highs 2680 (bar 111) and 2700 (bar 119) are below the spike high, so the range top has already rejected the bulls.", "Bar 115 fell from 2517.53 to 2358.62 in a single bar, showing fast two-sided movement inside the range and poor trend persistence.", "The final bar closed 67.02 below its own 2700 high, so there is no acceptance yet at the upper boundary; the bull push is an in-range leg, not a confirmed breakout.", "The 2357.18 and 2358.62 lows are roughly equal, which marks a range floor that has been tested twice and can break rather than hold."], "uncertainty": ["V2 D1 context adapted for the V1 PM input."]}, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management